invariant: INV-44
file: p384_wide_field.c
catches: p384_equiv_test
reason: a round of the Montgomery product drops the carry out of its
  second pass, so a running sum of 2^384 or more loses its top bit.
  bin/p384_equiv_test requires every product at the edges of each
  modulus and on random operands to be p384_field.c's.

--- old
    t[P384_WIDE_LIMBS] = t[P384_WIDE_LIMBS + 1] + (uint64_t)(top >> 64);
--- new
    t[P384_WIDE_LIMBS] = t[P384_WIDE_LIMBS + 1];
